    <li><a href="/items/country-breakfast-platter">Country Breakfast Platter — $6.99</a></li>
    <li><a href="/categories/breakfast">Full DQ Breakfast Menu</a></li>
  </ul>
    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <div class="faq-list"><div class="faq-item">
      <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">How much is the DQ Breakfast Burrito?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">The Breakfast Burrito is priced at $3.49 and contains roughly 380 calories, earning its spot as the cheapest hot breakfast option on the entire menu.</div></div>
    </div><div class="faq-item">
      <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">What is in the DQ Breakfast Burrito?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">It comes loaded with freshly scrambled eggs, melted cheese, and your selection of either crispy bacon or savory breakfast sausage, all rolled inside a warm flour tortilla.</div></div>
    </div><div class="faq-item">
      <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">Is the DQ Breakfast Burrito available at all locations?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">No, it isn't everywhere. DQ's breakfast lineup is restricted to select regional locations, mainly across the South and Midwest, and is only served until around 10:30 AM.</div></div>
    </div></div>
    <p style="margin-top:32px;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border);">
      For the complete 2026 DQ menu, visit <a href="/"><strong>The Queen Dairy Menu</strong></a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section section-alt"><div class="container article-body" style="max-width:920px;">
<h2>Breakfast Burrito — Best Portable Morning Option</h2>
<p>When you're running late and need breakfast behind the wheel, the Breakfast Burrito is the ultimate companion. Compact, neat, and handheld, it gives you pure savory breakfast goodness without the hassle of forks or messy sauces. For a hassle-free morning meal under $4, this burrito is unmatched. You can view all our morning offerings on <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a>.</p>
